        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007972",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have made meaningful changes to our practices over the past several years, and because our account management practices are evolutionary and dynamic, it is possible that we may make further changes to these practices, some of which may produce positive, and others of which may produce adverse, effects on our operating results and financial position.",
        "start_character": 11279,
        "end_character": 11633
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-007972",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-007972-9fcc2384e16a45ea",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-007972",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We manage our investments in receivables using credit scoring, credit file data, non-credit-bureau attributes, and our proprietary risk evaluation systems developed and refined over more than 30 years of operating history.",
