        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "As we are obligated to compensate our bank partners for the duration of the underlying account, we recognize the fair value of these Bank partner fees within Card and loan servicing on the accompanying Consolidated Statements of Income on the date we acquire the underlying receivable.",
